  "description": "While out at a trendy cosplay bar with a friend, Si-Yun finds himself captivated by a striking bartender named Ara, who is sporting a pair of plush bunny ears. The night takes a chaotic turn when Si-Yun accidentally splashes a drink directly onto her headpiece. Flustered and desperate to make amends, he reaches out to help her remove the damp accessory, but as his fingers graze the fur, he freezes. The texture isn't synthetic! It’s warm, pulsing, and inexplicably real. \n\nNoticing his shock, Ara quickly pulls Si-Yun away from the thumping music and prying eyes to a secluded corner of the bar. After a heavy, hesitant silence, she finally lets her guard down. She reveals the soft, snow-white ears that are a part of her very being, whispering a confession that defies all logic: \"The truth is... I’m actually a real bunny.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
